{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Legion</strong> is a cooperative top-down shooter set in a distant future, where humanity, unified under a reborn Roman Empire, enters a new era of interstellar expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>Legionary</strong>, an elite warrior assigned to carry out <strong>raids across entire sectors of the galaxy</strong>. Your objective: <strong>conquer worlds, eliminate robotic threats, and spread the glory of the Empire</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Tactical incursions on hostile planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sector represents a new battlefield. On enemy ground, you\u2019ll face <strong>robotic forces</strong> \u2014 war machines left behind by extinct civilizations, now out of control. These units respond with precision and aggression, defending strategic facilities with lethal force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Local co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter combat alongside a friend with <strong>local cooperative mode</strong>. Divide tasks, choose complementary equipment, and overcome mechanical threats together. Tactical support is essential for success during incursions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Craft, prepare, and risk it all</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, you can build your own loadout. Choose from primary weapons, support gear, and tactical tools.<br>But beware: <strong>if you fail the mission, you\u2019ll lose the gear you brought with you</strong> \u2014 meaning you\u2019ll need to rebuild it before trying again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Conquer a sector for the Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each completed mission strengthens the Empire\u2019s presence in the sector, revealing new targets and challenges. The campaign progresses dynamically, requiring you to adapt, improve your strategy, and prove your worth as <strong>the Empire\u2019s armed hand among the stars</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beyond the Horizon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/7ff200df36c6c8e79b24ed41dd2401b75a113b06.jpg"},{"name":"Baptism by Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/1cd13517ad39e94d72852c8fbff7de4305f3d061.jpg"},{"name":"Forged in Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/60f6d232b885ed8fc060a4e3ea704439e03533a7.jpg"},{"name":"Brothers in Arms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/effb1568d20be2364af8b09791e1eff089e1fa29.jpg"},{"name":"Planet Reclaimed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/e8f752163b025cc3ca675b5925174b98b01a3a1e.jpg"},{"name":"Rain of Circuits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/7d03fccc82e0af8bfdd3dcbfcce8e2a1f68449ac.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Wall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/62ef0f6e7822b40e3491ec66e14dda47f9cd2bc6.jpg"},{"name":"Untouched","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/f9d8e0b06007f1ebc745aaaed34cf4908fb02310.jpg"},{"name":"Versatile Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/07d33944d73bd1273a748cdd80caa63dafd093e9.jpg"},{"name":"Lethal Minimalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657030/c3b840c95a1968ba30f2e8d1e54ea60b6b528299.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657030?t=1747797510","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657030?t=1747797510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657030/7c16b7