port is essential for success during incursions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Craft, prepare, and risk it all</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each mission, you can build your own loadout. Choose from primary weapons, support gear, and tactical tools.<br>But beware: <strong>if you fail the mission, you\u2019ll lose the gear you brought with you</strong> \u2014 meaning you\u2019ll need to rebuild it before trying again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Conquer a sector for the Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each completed mission strengthens the Empire\u2019s presence in the sector, revealing new targets and challenges. The campaign progresses dynamically, requiring you to adapt, improve your strategy, and prove your worth as <strong>the Empire\u2019s armed hand among the stars</strong>.</p>","developers":["Hello World Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657030/7e8145e672d82e05b005c759d391c428ab20744a/header.jpg?t=1747797510","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3657030/877491/241a25105bc8c4256798cd3c2363d84cf96f51df/1750416584/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746035702","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3657030/877491/241a25105bc8c4256798cd3c2363d84cf96f51df/1750416584/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746035702","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3657030/877491/241a25105bc8c4256798cd3c2363d84cf96f51df/1750416584/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746035702","id":257130508,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130508/da4a722f